OL,3,GNEWSALondon falling behind EU capitals
OL,4,Aon air pollution
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon is far behind other major
OL,7,FEuropean cities such as Copenhagen,
OL,8,FBerlin and Brussels when it comes to
OL,9,Fclean air, new research has revealed.
OL,11,FAnalysis from Clean Cities places
OL,12,FGreater London 16th out of 40 European
OL,13,Fcities - a 'C' ranking - with experts
OL,14,Fwarning that new EU-wide strict
OL,15,Fpollution limits being introduced from
OL,16,F2030 could see the capital fall further
OL,17,Fbehind.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
