OL,3,GNEWSALondon falling behind EU capitals
OL,4,Aon air pollution
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough those rules would not apply to
OL,7,FLondon because the UK is no longer part
OL,8,Fof the EU, the report notes that the
OL,9,Fcapital would fail all four key
OL,10,Fmeasures if assessed against those same
OL,11,Flimits.
OL,13,FCity Hall said the capital's "air is
OL,14,Fdramatically cleaner than it was a
OL,15,Fdecade ago" but acknowledged there was
OL,16,F"more to do".
